{"seq":2,"slug":"budget-allocation","title":"预算分配与熔断机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/budget-allocation","wordCount":1263,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"预算分配与熔断机制\">预算分配与熔断机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预算治理把成本上限作为系统设计约束前置——像内存限制和延迟 SLA 一样对待。多层级配额（组织/团队/项目/用户/会话）配合渐进式降级策略（旗舰→中端→轻量→缓存→静态），确保预算耗尽时服务可用性优雅退化而非硬切断。会话级熔断器是 Agent 系统的必备防线——防止单个失控任务吞噬整体预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算是设计约束-不是事后审计\">预算是设计约束，不是事后审计</h2><p>预算管理的传统做法是月底看账单、季度做复盘。这对 LLM 支出不够——因为 LLM 成本可以在几小时内失控（Agent 循环、流量突增、配置错误）。正确的做法是<strong>把预算作为系统设计约束前置</strong>，像对待内存限制和延迟 SLA 一样对待成本上限。</p>\n<p>2025 年底 LangChain Agent 无限循环 11 天产生 $47,000 账单的事件，2026 年某团队月支出从 ¥5,600 飙升至 ¥84,000 的案例——都说明没有预算熔断的 LLM 系统是一颗定时炸弹。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[预算治理体系] --&gt; B[配额分配&lt;br/&gt;谁能花多少]&#10;    A --&gt; C[实时追踪&lt;br/&gt;已花多少]&#10;    A --&gt; D[熔断策略&lt;br/&gt;超限怎么办]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[组织级预算]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[团队级配额]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[项目级配额]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[用户级限额]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[实时累计]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[速率检测]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[趋势预测]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[降级&lt;br/&gt;切到更便宜的模型]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[限流&lt;br/&gt;降低请求频率]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[熔断&lt;br/&gt;停止非关键调用]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[告警&lt;br/&gt;通知负责人]\">graph TD\n    A[预算治理体系] --&gt; B[配额分配&lt;br/&gt;谁能花多少]\n    A --&gt; C[实时追踪&lt;br/&gt;已花多少]\n    A --&gt; D[熔断策略&lt;br/&gt;超限怎么办]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[组织级预算]\n    B --&gt; B2[团队级配额]\n    B --&gt; B3[项目级配额]\n    B --&gt; B4[用户级限额]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[实时累计]\n    C --&gt; C2[速率检测]\n    C --&gt; C3[趋势预测]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[降级&lt;br/&gt;切到更便宜的模型]\n    D --&gt; D2[限流&lt;br/&gt;降低请求频率]\n    D --&gt; D3[熔断&lt;br/&gt;停止非关键调用]\n    D --&gt; D4[告警&lt;br/&gt;通知负责人]</pre><h2 id=\"多层级配额体系\">多层级配额体系</h2><h3 id=\"层级设计\">层级设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>控制对象</th>\n<th>典型预算</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>超限处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组织级</td>\n<td>整个公司</td>\n<td>$50,000/月</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>硬断 + CEO 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队级</td>\n<td>业务团队</td>\n<td>$10,000/月</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>降级 + TL 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目级</td>\n<td>单个产品/功能</td>\n<td>$3,000/月</td>\n<td>月/周</td>\n<td>降级 + PM 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>单个终端用户</td>\n<td>$0.50/天</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>限流 + 用户提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话级</td>\n<td>单次 Agent 任务</td>\n<td>$5.00/session</td>\n<td>任务</td>\n<td>终止任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配额分配策略\">配额分配策略</h3><p><strong>固定配额</strong>：每个层级分配固定额度。简单但僵化——月中用完就停。</p>\n<p><strong>弹性配额</strong>：允许短期超支（借用下月额度），但触发告警和审批。</p>\n<p><strong>按比例分配</strong>：按历史用量 + 增长系数自动调整。适合快速增长期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BudgetConfig {&#10;  entity_id: string; // 团队/项目/用户 ID&#10;  entity_type: &#39;org&#39; | &#39;team&#39; | &#39;project&#39; | &#39;user&#39; | &#39;session&#39;;&#10;  budget_usd: number; // 预算额度&#10;  period: &#39;monthly&#39; | &#39;weekly&#39; | &#39;daily&#39; | &#39;per_session&#39;;&#10;  soft_limit_pct: number; // 软限制百分比（如 80%）&#10;  hard_limit_pct: number; // 硬限制百分比（如 100%）&#10;  overflow_allowed: boolean; // 是否允许弹性超支&#10;  overflow_max_pct: number; // 最大超支比例（如 120%）&#10;  on_soft_limit: &#39;alert&#39; | &#39;degrade&#39; | &#39;throttle&#39;;&#10;  on_hard_limit: &#39;alert&#39; | &#39;degrade&#39; | &#39;block&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BudgetConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entity_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 团队/项目/用户 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entity_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'org'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'team'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'project'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'user'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'session'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  budget_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预算额度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'monthly'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'weekly'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'daily'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'per_session'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  soft_limit_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 软限制百分比（如 80%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hard_limit_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 硬限制百分比（如 100%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  overflow_allowed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 是否允许弹性超支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  overflow_max_pct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最大超支比例（如 120%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  on_soft_limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alert'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degrade'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'throttle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  on_hard_limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alert'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degrade'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'block'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"熔断策略设计\">熔断策略设计</h2><h3 id=\"渐进式降级-优于硬切\">渐进式降级（优于硬切）</h3><p>预算接近上限时，不是直接拒绝请求，而是渐进降级——保证服务可用性的同时控制成本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预算消耗</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0-70%</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>全模型可用，无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70-85%</td>\n<td>预警</td>\n<td>告警 + 推荐使用更便宜模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>85-95%</td>\n<td>降级</td>\n<td>强制路由到轻量模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>95-100%</td>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>限制请求频率 + 轻量模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;100%</td>\n<td>熔断</td>\n<td>仅允许关键路径，其余队列化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class BudgetCircuitBreaker:&#10;    def __init__(self, config: BudgetConfig):&#10;        self.config = config&#10;        self.spent = 0.0&#10;&#10;    def get_allowed_model(self, requested_model: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        usage_pct = self.spent / self.config.budget_usd&#10;&#10;        if usage_pct &lt; 0.70:&#10;            return requested_model  # 正常使用&#10;&#10;        if usage_pct &lt; 0.85:&#10;            # 预警：允许使用但记录&#10;            self.alert(&quot;approaching_limit&quot;, usage_pct)&#10;            return requested_model&#10;&#10;        if usage_pct &lt; 0.95:&#10;            # 降级：强制使用便宜模型&#10;            return self.downgrade_model(requested_model)&#10;&#10;        if usage_pct &lt; 1.0:&#10;            # 限流：便宜模型 + 速率限制&#10;            self.throttle()&#10;            return self.cheapest_model()&#10;&#10;        # 熔断：仅关键路径通过&#10;        if not self.is_critical_path():&#10;            raise BudgetExhaustedError()&#10;        return self.cheapest_model()&#10;&#10;    def downgrade_model(self, model: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        DOWNGRADE_MAP = {&#10;            &quot;claude-opus-4-6&quot;: &quot;claude-sonnet-4-6&quot;,&#10;            &quot;claude-sonnet-4-6&quot;: &quot;claude-haiku-4-5&quot;,&#10;            &quot;gpt-5.2&quot;: &quot;gpt-5-mini&quot;,&#10;            &quot;gpt-5-mini&quot;: &quot;gpt-5-nano&quot;,&#10;        }&#10;        return DOWNGRADE_MAP.get(model, model)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BudgetCircuitBreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, config: BudgetConfig):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_allowed_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, requested_model: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        usage_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.config.budget_usd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> usage_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> requested_model  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 正常使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> usage_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 预警：允许使用但记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"